# Locally acquired market data is potentially licensed. Keep raw captures, normalized
# derivatives, and their adjacent manifests out of Git until storage/redistribution terms
# have been established. An operator may force-add later only after that review.
backend/data/tfex/historical/.staging/
backend/data/tfex/historical/raw/
backend/data/tfex/historical/normalized/

# This sanitized probe result is operator/application-specific evidence, not a universal
# SDK fact. Keep it local; universal API facts belong in tests and documentation.
backend/data/tfex/official/settrade_capability.json

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/

# Note: backend/uv.lock IS committed - reproducible environments matter for replay parity.
# Note: backend/data/tfex/holidays/*.json IS committed - imported exchange metadata is
# versioned data, and a replay must be reproducible from the repository alone.
